    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_global_merge_func" kindref="compound">GlobalMergeFunc</ref> is a <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_module_pass" kindref="compound">ModulePass</ref> that implements a function merging mechanism using stable function hashes. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>It identifies and merges functions with matching hashes across modules to optimize binary size. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
